cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite it, and cite the sources of the queries you use (listed under references and in CREDITS.md)."
title: "sdg-tech-tagger-rs: tagging texts with SDGs and digital technologies by published queries"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  A Rust port of the R package text2sdg (Aurora, Elsevier, SIRIS and Auckland
  SDG query systems) with a Python interface, in a mode that returns what
  text2sdg 1.1.2 returns and a mode with corrections that restore the published
  queries; two versions of a set of queries on advanced digital technologies;
  and both written as Web of Science queries.
keywords:
  - sustainable development goals
  - SDG
  - text2sdg
  - Aurora
  - Elsevier
  - SIRIS
  - Auckland
  - digital technologies
  - Web of Science
  - OpenAlex
  - bibliometrics
